  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><p>MOBO is an <strong>all-in-one mobility and recovery brand</strong> designed to help people move better, train harder, and stay pain-free.</p><p>Our flagship product is a <strong>7-in-1 soft tissue massage and myofascial release tool</strong> that replaces multiple recovery tools with one simple, effective solution. It’s built for real life—home, gym, clinic, or travel.</p><p>MOBO makes professional-grade recovery <strong>simple, accessible, and effective</strong>.</p><p><img src=\"https://mymobo.com/cdn/shop/files/mobo-muscle-release-tool-recovery-mobility.jpg?v=1678877455&width=1400\" style=\"width:512px;max-width:100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dib\" alt=\"mobo-muscle-release-tool-recovery-mobility.jpg?v=1678877455&amp;width=1400\"></p><hr><h2><strong>🔥 What makes us different</strong></h2><ul><li><p><strong>7 tools in 1</strong> – one device replaces foam rollers, balls, and sticks</p></li><li><p><strong>Built on movement science</strong>, not trends</p></li><li><p><strong>Used and trusted by professionals</strong> (PTs, trainers, coaches)</p></li><li><p><strong>Education-first brand</strong> – we teach, not hype</p></li><li><p><strong>Designed for longevity</strong>, injury prevention, and daily use</p></li></ul><hr><h2><strong>💰 How affiliates earn</strong></h2><ul><li><p><strong>15% commission</strong> on every referred sale</p></li><li><p><strong>60-day cookie window</strong></p></li><li><p>Earn on <strong>total order value</strong></p></li><li><p>Track sales via your <strong>unique link or discount code</strong></p></li><li><p>No cap on earnings</p></li></ul><p>Simple. Transparent. Scalable.</p><p><img src=\"https://mymobo.com/cdn/shop/files/comparison_table_2.png?v=1695390375&width=1200\" style=\"width:512px;max-width:100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dib\" alt=\"comparison_table_2.png?v=1695390375&amp;width=1200\"></p><hr><h2><strong>💪 How to promote MOBO</strong></h2><p>We encourage <strong>authentic, education-led content</strong>.</p><p><strong>What converts best:</strong></p><ul><li><p>Mobility &amp; recovery routine</p></li><li><p>“How I use MOBO” demos</p></li><li><p>Injury prevention tips</p></li><li><p>Gym, clinic, or at-home use</p></li><li><p>Short-form video (Reels, TikTok)<br><br></p></li></ul><p>If you help people move better, <strong>MOBO is built for you</strong>.</p><hr><h2>Web search results</h2><ul><li><p><a href=\"https://mymobo.com/pages/work-with-us?srsltid=AfmBOoqDF-L3pAqQHI2jNNd_1swqpMJr0neV-nb6Fix0pwSDh3JYvYpA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Work With Us – MOBO</a><br>Overview of MOBO’s affiliate and partnership positioning, highlighting recovery and mobility use cases.</p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://mymobo.com/pages/about-us?srsltid=AfmBOorCsWZe2AzEwPEDmrNSOuSkx1G-boRIMjK-77EbEljm1qhIExKg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">About Us – MOBO | Your all-in-one mobility solution</a><br>Brand background and mission behind MOBO’s mobility-first approach.</p></li><li><p><a href=\"https://mymobo.com/?srsltid=AfmBOoq3NFl86I_ZC6ddX4APAIe3_QoZBfj6uSRQfJfqR8n_ZHOdqFxF\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">MOBO – Your all-in-one mobility solution</a><br>Product overview detailing the 7-in-1 functionality and benefits.</p></li></ul><hr><p><br></p></div>",
